      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Patients with malignant tumours of the ENT, who show signs of tumour progression after operation, radiation and chemotherapy, could be treated with a new combined therapy. We present a patient who was successfully treated by combined radiation and chemotherapy with Cisplatin, Ifosfamid, and BCNU. This therapy offers a chance of tumour reduction even for repeatedly treated patients. The relief of pain proves the success of the therapy."},
